<title>BRAZIL: Telebras Jan results may be out this wk.</title>
<headline>Telebras Jan results may be out this wk.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state-owned telecommunications firm Telebras will probably release its results for January this week, said a top company official.</p>
<p>&quot;January results will probably be out this week,&quot; said Telebras president Fernando Xavier Ferreira.</p>
<p>In 1996, Telebras showed a net consolidated profit of 2.756 billion reais.</p>
<p>((--William Schomberg, Brasilia Newsroom 5561 2230358))</p>
